    <briefdescription>
<para>Controller for the player entity, handling movement, jumping, and physics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class processes keyboard and gamepad input, updates the player position and velocity, and handles jump physics (variable jump height, gravity, and grounded detection). It also integrates with the audio system to play jump and landing sound effects.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The controller works in conjunction with the physics system and collision resolution performed in the scene. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classGameWorld" kindref="compound">GameWorld</ref>, <ref refid="structTransform" kindref="compound">Transform</ref>, <ref refid="classSoundManager" kindref="compound">SoundManager</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
